/P 93 0 R
/E (Data Analytics is the process of examining raw data with the objective of drawing conclusions, identifying patterns, and supporting informed decision-making. In today's increasingly data-driven business environment, organizations depend on the structured analysis of their operational data to understand performance, identify inefficiencies, and plan future strategy. Data Analytics as a discipline draws upon a range of tools and techniques, from spreadsheet-based analysis to programming-based data manipulation and visual, dashboard-driven reporting. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
