/T (Organizations generate large volumes of raw data through their everyday operations, but this data carries little practical value until it is processed into a form that supports decision- making. The core problem addressed throughout this internship was learning how to convert raw, unstructured, or messy datasets into clear, actionable business insight using a structured analytical workflow: )
/E (Organizations generate large volumes of raw data through their everyday operations, but this data carries little practical value until it is processed into a form that supports decision- making. The core problem addressed throughout this internship was learning how to convert raw, unstructured, or messy datasets into clear, actionable business insight using a structured analytical workflow: )
/Pg 16 0 R
