<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 94 0 R
/T (This workflow was applied practically across the internship:in Excel, by summarizing a large orders dataset into pivot-table-based business metrics;in Python and Pandas, by exploring a transactional dataset and separately cleaning a messy exercise-tracking dataset with missing and duplicate records; and in the Week 4 capstone project, by carrying a raw sales-transaction dataset through cleaning, validation, and exploratory business analysis to arrive at concrete, stakeholder-ready recommendations. )
/E (This workflow was applied practically across the internship:in Excel, by summarizing a large orders dataset into pivot-table-based business metrics;in Python and Pandas, by exploring a transactional dataset and separately cleaning a messy exercise-tracking dataset with missing and duplicate records; and in the Week 4 capstone project, by carrying a raw sales-transaction dataset through cleaning, validation, and exploratory business analysis to arrive at concrete, stakeholder-ready recommendations. )
